{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X的叙事压缩使部分心理转折的原因不如Y交代得充分，尤其结尾没有Y那样明确地表达即使始终无人亲近也要好好生活的决心。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的重点句加亮，扫一眼就能抓住每段发生了什么；感受又随音乐分段出现，不必同时消化所有文字，音乐细节也比Y更具体，能感到音色、节奏、身体反应和情绪之间的细微变化。Y的优势是叙事解释更充分，人物为什么动摇、最后如何面对未来，交代得更完整。总体而言，作为边听边扫的普通观众，我更愿意选X，但它确实牺牲了一部分故事的解释力和结尾的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6b5283b2-e67c-48b4-9b35-9f794be943fe", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T080209976076Z", "elapsed_seconds": 66.938, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T08:03:16.921604+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "358bf714afb6bb69e0075ebd4c1a43d36492abe75075fab5510ba7067a1aead5", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att